# Singleton Adapter Pattern
RULE: All venue/adapter factory functions MUST use singleton caching. One instance per venue across loops.
WHY: Without caching, 325 instruments × 100 dates = 32,500 adapter instances; with singleton = 1.
CODEX: 03-observability/README.md, 02-data/subscription-model.md
DO: Module-level `_ADAPTER_CACHE`; return cached if exists; lazy-load and cache on first use
NEVER: Create new adapter instance per iteration; skip cache for factory functions
